# Adw.SwitchRow is libadwaita 1.2 and Adw.SpinRow is 1.4.  Everything current
# has both -- Ubuntu 24.04 ships 1.5, Fedora and Arch ship newer -- but on an
# older libadwaita the preference rows would raise AttributeError while the
# window was being built, which reads like a bug in this program rather than
